#: ../Site/DemosPage.qml:223
msgid "Running it loads the player and two Lottie files (HAL-C2's avatars), read and drawn by Ljós with no JavaScript Lottie library. Try Pause, Again, and the speed buttons to control the looping dance and one-shot genie. Both play at half speed when reduced motion is on, pause off screen, and use no CPU while idle."
